            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Walking, the walls are ship's panelling, a panel of its own for hallways, offices, living quarters and the yard</li>
<li>The welder faces the seam it welds: the torch stays on the panel in front of it</li>
<li>A frame counter in the corner: frames a second, the rate it is held to, and the slowest frame</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
